#
# The build context is uploaded to the builder before anything runs, and the
# builder may be on the other side of a network — so this file is the difference
# between a two-second transfer and shipping ten gigabytes to a Kubernetes pod.

# Host build output. 9 GB, entirely rebuilt inside the image, and mixing host
# artefacts into a container build is how a stale object file silently survives.
target/

# Local clones of the reference implementations. Gitignored, never built, never
# linked — and they have no business crossing into an image.
references/

.git/
.github/

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Session and scratch files.
claude.session
*.log
